        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    income = 75_000\n    tax_brackets = [\n        (10_000, 0.00),\n        (30_000, 0.10),\n        (60_000, 0.15),\n        (float(\"inf\"), 0.25),\n    ]\n\n    total_tax = 0\n    previous_limit = 0\n\n    for limit, rate in tax_brackets:\n        taxable_in_bracket = max(0, min(income, limit) - previous_limit)\n        total_tax += taxable_in_bracket * rate\n        previous_limit = limit\n        if income <= limit:\n            break\n\n    return round(total_tax)\n```",
